  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing an Electronic Platform for Japan Pre-entry Tuberculosis Screening Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Japanese government plans to introduce a pre-entry TB screening (JPETS) programme and entrusts the Research Institute of Tuberculosis, Japan Anti-Tuberculosis Association (RIT-JATA) with the responsibility to coordinate with the IOM to develop the program, and requests IOM to develop JPETS Information Management System (JIMS) that will enable the Centre for JPETS Quality Assessment, counting on  IOM&apos;s expertise and global experience in pre-migration TB detection services and its technical capacity to develop information management system.</narrative>
  </description>
